   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Kam,<div><br></div><div>參考以下R程式與附件結果:</div><div><br></div><div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"># title: OBV computing</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"># date: 2016.01.06</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\">min.K.2015 &lt;- read.csv(&quot;2015_min_K.txt&quot;, header=TRUE)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"># str(min.K.2015) # 59359*8</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\">min.K.2015$obv &lt;- 0</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\">for (i in 2:nrow(min.K.2015)) {</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\">  if (min.K.2015[i, &quot;Close&quot;] &gt;= min.K.2015[i-1, &quot;Close&quot;]) {</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\">    min.K.2015$obv[i] &lt;- min.K.2015$obv[i-1] + min.K.2015$Volume[i]</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\">  }</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\">  else {</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\">    min.K.2015$obv[i] &lt;- min.K.2015$obv[i-1] - min.K.2015$Volume[i]</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\">  }</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\">}</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\">head(min.K.2015)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\">tail(min.K.2015)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"># end</font></div><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-jnn8Nv8nZhI/VowaYu_E7-I/AAAAAAAAKFY/lREHO02zzD8/s1600/obv.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-jnn8Nv8nZhI/VowaYu_E7-I/AAAAAAAAKFY/lREHO02zzD8/s1600/obv.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238107182000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2W0RT13_4F7MifJhmhG1vI\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-jnn8Nv8nZhI/VowaYu_E7-I/AAAAAAAAKFY/lREHO02zzD8/s400/obv.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"353\"></a></p><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><br>這位仁兄於 2016年1月5日星期二 UTC+8下午4時03分43秒寫道：</div></div>"
